? Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Sapphire; Mox Ruby; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Aerid Konstrari; Heartwood Token
? Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Ruby; Mox Emerald; Mox Emerald
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
